        "title": {
          "ja": "自然・端点微分指定スプラインとPCHIP",
          "en": "Natural and clamped splines versus PCHIP"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "平坦部を持つ単調データ・3次式・直線の固定3組で、C2連続性と形状保存を比較します。",
          "en": "Compare C2 continuity and shape preservation on three fixed data sets: a monotone plateau, a cubic and a straight line."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "実binary64の節点と値を使用。自然条件は両端2階微分ゼロ、clamped条件は入力端点1階微分です。",
          "en": "Use actual binary64 knots and values. Natural conditions set both endpoint second derivatives to zero; clamped conditions prescribe the first derivatives from the input."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "3次Bスプラインの配置行列を解きde Boor評価。別経路でPCHIPの調和平均・端点制限とHermite評価を実装します。",
          "en": "Solve a cubic B-spline collocation system and evaluate it with de Boor recursion. A separate path implements PCHIP harmonic slopes, endpoint limiting and Hermite evaluation."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "正確な有理2階微分系・有理PCHIP・SciPy 1.14.1を照合。端点15記録は16スカラー出力・13異なる入力。平坦部の負値は実binary64をFraction化した独立式で示します。",
          "en": "Compare with exact rational second-derivative systems, rational PCHIP and SciPy 1.14.1. Fifteen endpoint records contain sixteen scalar outputs from thirteen distinct inputs. Independent Fraction formulas show plateau undershoot for the actual binary64 data."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "PCHIPは通常C1でありC2とは限りません。一般データの最良近似・外挿・ノイズ平滑化は対象外。SciPyは原著完全閲読の代用ではありません。",
          "en": "PCHIP is generally C1, not necessarily C2. Best approximation, extrapolation and noise smoothing are outside scope. A SciPy comparison does not substitute for reading the original papers."
        },
